# Secret Santa

A little holiday magic, shared. Organize your Secret Santa with a Telegram bot.

## Run locally

Start the bot with a token from [@BotFather](https://t.me/BotFather):

```sh
export TelegramBot__Token="your-bot-token"
dotnet run --project SecretSanta.TelegramBot
```

Run the Mini App and API at `http://localhost:5080`:

```sh
dotnet run --project SecretSanta.TelegramApi
```

The API project serves the vanilla-JavaScript frontend in
[`SecretSanta.TelegramWebApp`](./SecretSanta.TelegramWebApp/). Telegram requires
a public HTTPS URL for the deployed Mini App.
